#====================================================================
# DRAFT-libfprint-1.94.10-contents-api-truncated-conanfile-empty-package — contents API 推送截断 conanfile.py → 缺 build/package 方法 → Conan 空包,test_package 找不到 include
#====================================================================

id:                     DRAFT-libfprint-1.94.10-contents-api-truncated-conanfile-empty-package
trigger_tool:           conan|conan create|conan-verify|contents-api
phase:                  packaging|testing
error_signature:        package\(\): WARN: No files in this package!|Imported target .* includes non-existent path .*\/include|conan create failed

severity:               2
category:               ci|packaging|conan|byte-corruption|contents-api|empty-package
match_keywords:         No files in this package, Imported target includes non-existent path, empty package, conanfile 截断, truncated conanfile, contents API, 字节损坏, 远端文件截断, 本地通过 CI 失败, package() 缺失, build() 缺失

title:                  contents API 推送链路截断 conanfile.py(缺 build/package/package_info 方法) → Conan 默认空包 → test_package CMake 报 include 路径不存在

root_cause:             远端 conanfile.py 经 contents API 推送时被截断(4299B vs 本地 20707B,在 requirements() 注释处断掉),缺全部 build()/package()/generate()/package_info() 方法;Conan 对无 package() 的配方默认空操作 → 生成空包 "No files in this package!";CMakeDeps 据此生成 INTERFACE_INCLUDE_DIRECTORIES=<pkg>/include,test_package 配置时报 "Imported target includes non-existent path .../p/include",conan create 失败。本地文件完整、本地 CI 全绿,与 PR CI 矛盾,根因在推送链路而非配方。

affected_scope:         所有经 contents API/转码链路推送的 conanfile.py 与 notes.md;凡远端文件大小与本地差异明显、缺核心方法者;故障在 conan create / test_package 阶段暴露,与 checkout-pr 无关。

verification_cmd:       对比远端 raw 与本地字节(cmp 应无输出);grep 远端 conanfile 是否含 def build/def package/def package_info;wc -c 对比大小;conanfile 语法检查

rec_priority:           1
rec_approach:           push-clean-files-verify-bytes
rec_description:        用本地干净 conanfile.py(20707B, md5 0cc7ea476a99f8653f72bd425e8ba1db) 与 notes.md(11501B) 通过 contents API PUT 覆盖远端截断版(必须带 branch=<源分支> + sha + base64 content,base64 零空格),推送后字节级对比远端 raw 与本地(cmp 无输出),再触发 /rebuild。
rec_command:            curl -X PUT -H "Content-Type: application/json" -d '{"branch":"feat/libfprint-1.94.10","sha":"<旧blob sha>","content":"<base64>"}' "https://atomgit.com/api/v5/repos/{owner}/{repo}/contents/{path}?access_token=${TOKEN}"; 推送后 curl -sL ".../contents/{path}?ref=feat/libfprint-1.94.10" | base64 -d | cmp - <本地文件>
rec_auto_fix:           true
rec_impl:               push-verify

fallback_priority:      2
fallback_approach:      verify-file-before-rebuild
fallback_description:   若确认远端文件已与本地一致仍失败,再考虑配方本身问题(如 RUNPATH/.codesign 摘要失配,见 E999-draft-856F);不要盲目 /rebuild。
fallback_command:       先对比字节再决定;字节一致仍挂 → 查 E999-draft-856F codesign 摘要
fallback_auto_fix:      false
fallback_impl:

forbid_1_pattern:       (?s)No files in this package
forbid_1_reason:        空包说明 package() 未产出,先核对远端 conanfile 是否被截断/缺失方法,勿在本地配方上瞎改。
forbid_1_consequence:   本地已通过却反复修配方,浪费轮次,远端损坏仍存在。
